(19, 'Dhiraj Agrawal', 'envixagloballlp@gmail.com', '8511823266', 'Proposal for Use of Petro Polymer Fuel as Startup Fuel in Cement Kilns', 'I am writing to introduce an innovative and cost-effective alternative to high-speed diesel (HSD) and light diesel oil (LDO) currently used as startup fuel in cement kilnsâ€”Petro Polymer Fuel or Alternate Diesel Fuel (ADF), a refined plastic pyrolysis oil derived from non-recyclable mixed plastic waste.\r\nEnvixa Global LLP, a cleantech startup in the waste-to-energy sector, trades and produces Petro Polymer Fuel through an environmentally compliant pyrolysis process. This fuel offers comparable calorific value and combustion properties to HSD/LDO and is suitable for industrial use, including cement kiln ignition. Key advantages include:\r\nâ€¢	Cost savings over conventional HSD/LDO\r\nâ€¢	Sustainable waste management solution supporting circular economy goals\r\nâ€¢	Reduction in fossil fuel dependency and carbon footprint\r\nâ€¢	Compliance with CPCB and pollution control norms (as per ASTM/DIN standards)\r\nWe would be pleased to share our technical specifications, third-party test reports, and sample material for your evaluation. A pilot-scale trial can also be arranged to assess combustion performance in your kiln systems.\r\nPlease let us know a convenient time to discuss this further. We look forward to supporting your sustainability goals with this cleaner and economically viable alternative.\r\n', '2025-08-03 12:33:46'),
