(24, 'vishal singh', 'vishal.singh@mach-worldwide.com', '09220408052', 'Seamless Global Shipping â€“ Air, Ocean & Customs Solutions', 'Dear Sir,\r\nGreetings from Mach Worldwide Logistics!\r\nIt is a pleasure to connect with you.\r\nI would like to take this opportunity to introduce Mach Worldwide Logistics India Pvt. Ltd., a premier logistics and freight forwarding company established in 2012. We specialize in providing seamless transportation, distribution, and end-to-end supply chain solutions across all industry verticalsâ€”both domestically and internationally.\r\nAbout Us:\r\nHead Office: New Delhi\r\nBranches: Mumbai, Chennai, Chandigarh\r\nPan-India Presence: 15+ strategic partner locations\r\nGlobal Reach: Strong network of agents at all major ocean & air gateways\r\nCertifications: IATA, WCA, JCTRANS & ISO Certified\r\nLicensed: In-house CHA license for hassle-free customs clearance\r\nOur team of 70+ experienced professionals ensures efficient and cost-effective cargo movement with a strong focus on quality, compliance, and customer satisfaction. We proudly serve several leading Indian corporates and multinational companies with customized logistics solutions tailored to their unique requirements.\r\nWhy Choose Mach Worldwide Logistics?\r\nProven industry experience across verticals\r\nStrong global and local operational support\r\nEnd-to-end EXIM solutions\r\nEthics and service-driven approach\r\nNew Offering: Weekly ELAL Airways Freighter Service\r\nWe are now operating a weekly freighter service with ELAL Airways from Mumbai (Ex-BOM) with a capacity of 45 tons.\r\nDestinations Covered: JFK, LAX, EWR, MIA & ORD.\r\nWe would be delighted to explore potential collaboration opportunities with GALLANTT ISPAT LIMITED and become your trusted logistics partner.\r\nLooking forward to your positive response and the opportunity to support your logistics requirements.\r\nWarm regards,\r\nVishal', '2025-08-05 06:11:52'),
