(60, 'VIVEK KUMAR  VERMA', 'vivekkumar.verma@neml.in', '9451301083', 'Proposal for Scrap Auction Services with NEML', 'Dear Sir,\r\nI hope this message finds you well.\r\nI am writing on behalf of NeML (National e-Market Limited), Indiaâ€™s leading e-market platform for commodity trading and auction services. We specialize in providing transparent, efficient, and technology-driven solutions for scrap disposal through our well-established online auction system.\r\nWe would like to propose a collaboration with Gallant Steel Company for managing your scrap sales through e-auction on our platform. By partnering with NeML, your organization can benefit from:\r\nâ€¢	Wider Buyer Reach: Access to a large network of registered and verified scrap buyers across India.\r\nâ€¢	Transparency & Fair Pricing: Competitive bidding ensures maximum value realization for your scrap.\r\nâ€¢	Efficient Process: End-to-end auction management with real-time monitoring and reporting.\r\nâ€¢	Compliance & Documentation: Full support with regulatory compliance and transaction records.\r\nOur team will assist your company with the entire process, from onboarding and registration to auction execution and settlement.\r\nWe would be glad to schedule a meeting/demo at your convenience to explain the process in detail and discuss how NeML can add value to your scrap disposal operations.\r\nLooking forward to your positive response.\r\nBest Regards,\r\nVivek Kumar Verma\r\nExecutive\r\nNational e-Market Limited (NeML)\r\n9451301083| vivekkumar.verma@neml.in\r\n', '2025-08-19 08:08:57'),
