(94, 'Sangeeta Nambiyar', 'sangeeta@bhartiyaispat.com', '9892392638', 'Company Introduction letter ', 'Dear Sir / Madam,\r\nWe would like to take this opportunity to introduce BHARTIYA GROUP \r\nBIUM INDUSTRIES PVT LTD (Rolling Mill Division) \r\n\r\nHaving Two Rolling Mills Billet to Structural Steel Manufacturing\r\n\r\nUNIT 1: 16 Inch Hi Rolling Mill Having Capacity for Production up to 300 MT /Day \r\nUNIT 2: 12 Inch Automatic Rolling Mill for Production Capacity up to 150MT /Day \r\n\r\nBHARTIYA METACAST PVT LTD (Steel Melting & Recycling)\r\n\r\nHaving 20Ton Induction Furnace ( Megatherm India)  â€“ Converting M S Shredded / M S scrap / Sponge to Billet Manufacturing section 100x100 to 160x160 in 7/11 Continues caster from Concast India \r\n\r\nBHARTIYA MULTI METAL LLP (Trading in Structural Steel)\r\n\r\nStructural steel / TMT Bars / Round Bars/ Flats & Other steel related trading Arm of the group\r\nWe are one of the leading Structural Steel Section Manufacturers in western India and have been in this industry for the last six decades.\r\n\r\nWe are a company, and our brand name is autonomous with high quality and timely delivery. ISO 9001:2015 Certified.\r\n\r\nWe manufacture & trade a wide range of structural steel products in conformance to as appended below for your ready reference.\r\n\r\nIS 2062 : 2011 Grade \'A\' E-250 (Fe 410 W) / Grade BR, MS, HR, HT /E-350 / ASTM A36 & FE550DA36 Grade.\r\n\r\nProduct Range \r\nISA â€“ MS Angle	35x35x5 mm to 150x150x20 mm \r\nISA - Light Angle	20x3 mm ,25x3mm to 37x3mm\r\nISMB (LT,MD,Hvy)\r\n	100x50mm, 125x65mm, 150x75mm, 175x85mm, 200x100mm ,300x140 , 400x140 , 500x180 , 600x210 \r\nRSJ Poles	116x100 , 125x70 , 175x85 , 150x150 , 152x152 \r\nISMC â€“ Ms Channels	70x30mm, 75x40mm, 90x45mm, 100x50mm, 125x65mm, 150x75mm & 200x75mm & 250x80\r\nISNT â€“ Tee Section	T40x6 , T50x6 ,T60x40 ,T65x6 & T75x9mm\r\nTMT Bars/ Ms Plates	We are dealing with All sizes & Rolling Brands\r\nSpecial sections we mfrs	As per project demand\r\n	\r\nUSP / Why We ? \r\nSince we are Located in Wada, having many different types of Rolling Mills including small and Big Re- Rollers , We can also arrange for you M.S Flat Bars / Gate Channel / Round Bars / Square Bars as per your requirement along with Other Products together in same truck.\r\nMaterial emboss as ISI marked on the materials. \r\n INFRASTRUCTURE:\r\nÂ§        16â€ Automatic Rolling Mill\r\nÂ§        12â€ Semi-Automatic Rolling Mill\r\nÂ§        Induction Furnace of 20 MT \r\nÂ§        Fully Computerized Laboratory\r\nÂ§        Heavy Straightening Machine\r\nÂ§        Fully Mechanized Material Handling Facility\r\nÂ§        Production Capacity of 70,000MT per Annum.\r\nÂ§        In-House Weight Bridge of 60MT\r\nÂ§        Well Equipped Workshop.\r\nÂ§        Double Drove Furnace.\r\nÂ§        100Ft Cooling Platform\r\nWe supply to our Domestic and International clients.\r\nOur Products and production facility has been approved by various prestigious organization\'s & we are Regular Supplier of the below Corporate Clients including:\r\nCLIENT LIST:\r\n\r\nÂ§        Jaguar Overseas\r\nÂ§        J Kumar Infrastructure Ltd \r\nÂ§        Hindustan Construction Ltd (HCC)\r\nÂ§        Optech Enginnering Ltd \r\nÂ§        Karamtara Engineering Pvt. Ltd\r\nÂ§        Maharashtra Power and Transmission Structures Ltd.(M.P.T.S.L)\r\nÂ§        M.S.E.D.C.L\r\nÂ§        Omicron Engineers\r\nÂ§        Indian Railway (Engineering Division)\r\nÂ§        Sampada Automotive Pvt. Ltd\r\nÂ§        Hilton Forging Ltd.\r\nÂ§        Megha Engineering & Infrastructures Ltd (MEIL) (Bullet train project 2025 BKC)\r\nÂ§        John Galt International Ltd\r\nÂ§        Almighty Auto Ancillary\r\nÂ§        Hindalco Industries Ltd.\r\nÂ§        Maharashtra Power Generation Company.(MPGC)\r\nÂ§        Uttam Galva Steels Pvt. Ltd\r\nÂ§        Armec Cooling Tower Pvt Limited/ Armech Group\r\n\r\nI would appreciate it if you could forward this mail to your procurement and purchase team. It would be a great help to them in sourcing the material for their various projects and end use.\r\nRates are also offered in reasonable manner.\r\n\r\nWe shall be happy to cater to your Structural Steel requirements and look forward to your valued inquiries.\r\nKindly drop your inquiry on the below details, along with your contact details I shall Assist you for the same.\r\n\r\nBHARTIYA GROUP \r\nBIUM INDUSTRIES PVT LTD \r\nSangeeta Nambiyar\r\n(Sales Officer)\r\nCORPORATE MUMBAI OFFICE: \r\n15, Shramik Building, \r\nOpp Ganesh Talkies , \r\nLalbagh, Mumbai 400012\r\nCell No. 9892392638\r\nE-mail : sangeeta@bhartiyaispat.com/ sangeetanambiyar@gmail.com\r\nPlant: Survery No 179 to 182 & 272, 274 , Bhiwandi -Wada Rd , Vilalge Ghonsai (Met Naka) Taluka Wada , Dist : Palghar -421302\r\nWebsite: www.bhartiyaispat.com,    https://www.bhartiyaispat.com\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n', '2025-08-28 11:05:58'),
