(181, 'Shivam', 'nigama576@gmail.com', '8273869232', 'I am applying for the post of Assistant Engineer in your company.', 'Dear sir/mam\r\n\r\nI hope this email finds you well. I am writing to express my interest in the Assistant Engineer position at your company \r\n\r\nI have completed my B.tech in mechanical engineering from Js University, and I possess 2 year 6 month of experience in Uttam strips LTD Steel & iron plant CRS CTL pickling skin pass basic knowledge of ECL TLL & aniline. I am confident that my technical expertise, problem-solving abilities, and enthusiasm for engineering make me a strong candidate for this position.\r\n\r\nPlease find attached my resume for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills and experiences align with the needs of your team. I am available for an interview at your earliest convenience and can be reached at 8273869232 or via email at nigama576@gmail.com\r\n\r\nThank you for considering my application. I look forward to the possibility of contributing to your organization\r\n', '2025-09-19 14:18:14'),
