(210, 'VIJAY', 'managervijaydubey@yahoo.co.in', '9612289932', 'Regarding Senior Position for Stores & Purchase', 'Dear Sir,\r\nI have 25 years rich experience in the field of stores & Purchase(i.e. inventory management, store management, material planning and procurement, scrap management, internal and external audit, annual budget plan, monthly MIS, Inventory analysis, taking care of fast and Non-moving items, legal compliance, vendor development,ect.)\r\nI have done MA-ECONOMICS, MBA-FINANCE, DMM (diploma in material management) and presently I am working in Cement Industry to leading entire store functions of three plants. Kindly review my profile for any suitable position in your esteemed organisation. I am attaching my CV for your kind consideration.\r\n\r\nWith regards,\r\nVijay Nath Dubey \r\nMob:9612289932\r\n          7005500793', '2025-09-26 09:39:46'),
