(227, 'Dhavnesh Bhagat', 'dhavnesh.endeavour@gmail.com', '9872199537', 'Team Endeavour, IIT Bombay', 'I am Dhavnesh, Business Team Lead from Team Endeavour, IIT Bombay which is going to compete in the International Robowars Championship during Techfest 2025 which is taking place from Dec 22â€“24. Techfest is Asiaâ€™s largest science & technology festival with 1.8 lakh+ visitors and 100,000+ global online viewers.\r\n\r\nEvery year, the International Robowars is the biggest combat robotics event in Asia, featuring teams from Russia, Malaysia, USA, UK, Brazil, South Korea, Germany, and 15+ other countries. This time our team will also be competing in the competition. We are seeking sponsorship to support our project.\r\n\r\nCurrently we have a team of 12 passionate members who are subdivided in Mechanical and Electrical subdivisions. Till date we have decided the bot design and the weapon to be used. To successfully complete our project we require sponsors to fund our Bot.\r\n\r\nBranding Opportunities\r\nLogo on our robot, T-shirts, and pit area.\r\nArena promotion through posters and live shout-outs.\r\nSocial media amplification.\r\nDirect engagement with thousands of live spectators.\r\n\r\nWe would be delighted to discuss this further at your convenience and share a detailed proposal.\r\nThank you for considering this opportunityâ€”we look forward to welcomeÂ you as a proud partner of Team Endeavour at RoboWars, Techfest 2025.\r\n', '2025-10-04 17:51:27'),
(228, 'SOMU ENTERPRISES', 'somu.enterprises2004@gmail.com', '09475891655', 'About to Vendor Code & Supply of Hardwood/Timber/Plywood/Pine wood/Sal wood/Cable Drum and all types of Construction Materials', 'Dear Sir,\r\nI hope this email finds you well!\r\nWe SOMU ENTERPRISES Manufacture/Supply of Hardwood, Timber, Plywood, Pine wood, Sal wood, Firewood, Saw Dust & Cable Drum in different sizes and also want to be a vendor code in your organisation.\r\nI\'m available and would love to hear your thoughts & We will be proud to work with you.\r\nThank you for your time, and I look forward to hearing back from you soon.', '2025-10-05 07:09:35'),
(229, 'SOMU ENTERPRISES', 'somu.enterprises2004@gmail.com', '09475891655', 'About to Vendor Code & Supply of Hardwood/Timber/Plywood/Pine wood/Sal wood/Cable Drum and all types of Construction Materials', 'Dear Sir,\r\nI hope this message finds you well!\r\nWe SOMU ENTERPRISES Manufacture/Supply of Hardwood, Timber, Plywood, Pine wood, Sal wood, Firewood, Saw Dust & Cable Drum in different sizes and also want to be a vendor code in your organisation.\r\nI\'m available and would love to hear your thoughts & We will be proud to work with you.\r\nThank you for your time, and I look forward to hearing back from you soon.', '2025-10-06 05:39:29'),
(230, 'Gary Charles', 'garycharles@dominatebanners.com', '8054002077', 'DominateBanners', 'We can place your website banner on top position in search engines when someone searches your keywords. If you are interested, fill online quote form on our website or send us your keywords and we\'ll tell you guaranteed amount of traffic that you can get. You can do online demo on our website and see how your website will appear on top of search engines.', '2025-10-06 05:41:12'),
