(233, 'Navarajan VThanabal', 'navarajan268@gmail.com', '0165581938', 'Invitation to  Asia Pacific Enterprise Award (APEA) 2026- India Edition', 'To, Gallantt team, \r\n\r\nMy name is Navarajan @Ethan from Enterprise Asia, a regional NGO promoting entrepreneurship and sustainable practices across Asia. Through our flagship program, the Asia Pacific Enterprise Awards (APEA) 2026 India Edition, we recognize outstanding companies and leaders for their achievements. The event will be held in March 2026, and the venue will be in JW Marriott Mumbai. \r\n\r\nWe admire Gallantt\'s leadership and innovation, and I would be honored to explore opportunities for your participation in the APEA India Chapter. May I kindly request your assistance in connecting me with your CEO, CFO, Media consultant or someone who is in-charge to discuss this further?\r\n\r\nThank you for your kind attention, and I look forward to engaging with your team.\r\n', '2025-10-07 04:05:34'),
(234, 'Samarth Trivedi', 'samarth.trivedi@cctygroup.com', '06353162454', 'RFQ', 'We are currently seeking a range of steel products, including steel tubes, steel bars, and steel wire. If any of these items fall within your portfolio, please reach out to us for a Request for Quotation (RFQ) via the provided mobile number or email.', '2025-10-07 04:22:55'),
