(354, 'Tarun Pathak', 'sudhir@om-engineers.in', '08130846177', 'High-Quality Steel Forged Products for Your Business Needs', 'Dear Sir,\r\n\r\nI hope this message finds you well.\r\n\r\nI am Tarun Pathak from Om Engineers. We are proud to be recognised as one of the trusted manufacturers of light and heavy steel forgings with more than 35 years of experience in the industry. Our products are known for their strength, reliability, and precision, backed by in-house forging, machining, heat treatment, and testing facilities.\r\n\r\nOur wide product range includes:\r\n- Forged Shafts\r\n- Forged Gears & Gear Rings\r\n- Forged Couplings, Universal Gear Couplings & Spindles\r\n- Forged Pinion Shafts, Pinions & Bull Gears\r\n- Forged Hollow Tubes, Blocks & Rings\r\n- Fabricated Gearboxes & Rolling Mill Spares\r\n\r\nWith stringent quality controls, MSME/SSI registration, and adherence to third-party inspections, we ensure every product meets the highest standards of performance. Over the years, we have been serving industries like Aerospace, Power, Steel, Railways, Defence, Cement, Sugar, and Wind Energy, building long-term relationships based on trust and consistency.\r\n\r\nFor your reference, I have attached our detailed company profile and product catalogue. Please let us know if you have any current or upcoming requirements for forged components, and we would be glad to provide further details or quotations.\r\n\r\nLooking forward to your kind consideration.\r\nBest regards,\r\nTarun Pathak\r\nSales Manager\r\nOm Engineers\r\nðŸ“ž +91-8130846177\r\nâœ‰ï¸ sudhir@om-engineers.in\r\nðŸŒ www.om-engineers.in', '2025-11-12 06:11:23'),
