(374, 'Vijay Laxmi', 'laxmivijay232@gmail.com', '7827534986', 'Fe 500D TMT Bars ', 'Hello Gallant Team,\r\n\r\nI am planning to purchase Gallant TMT bars for my house construction. Before finalizing the order, Could you please help with the following details for verification and quality confirmation:\r\n\r\n1. Grade availability â€“ Please confirm whether Gallant 500D grade is available.\r\n\r\n\r\n2. Product proof â€“ Kindly share clear photos/videos of the actual TMT bars showing:\r\n\r\nBrand name embossed on the rod (Gallant)\r\n\r\nGrade marking (500D or 550D)\r\n\r\nSize marking (8mm / 10mm / 12mm / 16mm etc.)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n3. MTC (Mill Test Certificate) â€“ Please share the latest Mill Test Certificate (PDF/photo) which includes:\r\n\r\nChemical composition\r\n\r\nPhysical test results\r\n\r\nManufacturer details\r\n\r\nHeat / Lot number\r\n\r\nManufacturing date\r\n\r\nGrade confirmation (500D or 550D)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n4. Batch / Heat Number â€“ Please provide the batch / lot / heat number so that I can match it with the bars delivered on site.\r\n\r\n\r\n5. Billing & delivery details â€“ Please confirm:\r\n\r\nGST invoice availability\r\n\r\nTransport charges\r\n\r\nDelivery timeline\r\n\r\nPrice per kg/ton (including taxes)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nOnce these details are verified, I will proceed with the final order. Kindly share all details on WhatsApp as soon as possible.\r\n\r\nThank you.\r\nVijay Laxmi', '2025-11-16 07:35:29'),
