(401, 'SAZID KHAN', 'sazidkhan.solitairevalley@gmail.com', '9151755541', 'Urgent: Pending Delivery of 20 Tons Steel â€“ Payment Already Made on 14-11-2025', 'Dear Gallant Ispat Ltd,\r\n\r\nThis is to inform you that The Innovators Digital Ads Private Limited (Solitaire Valley, Jhalwa, Prayagraj) made the payment on 14-11-2025, yet we have still not received the 20 tons of steel (sariya).\r\n\r\nIn addition, our company also makes payments through RudraShakti Infrastructure Pvt. Ltd. and SR Enterprises, but despite that, there has been no progress in the delivery.\r\n\r\nWe have been purchasing steel from your company for the last 10â€“12 years, but this time the delay in your delivery is extremely disappointing.\r\n\r\nIf your company does not have a reliable transporter, then please arrange a good and trustworthy transporter so that the clientâ€™s delivery can be completed on time.\r\nSuch fraud or irresponsible transporters should be removed immediately, as they harm both your companyâ€™s reputation and our ongoing work.\r\n\r\nIf you are unable to supply the material on time, kindly inform us clearly so that we can arrange steel from another company.\r\n\r\nPlease update us immediately on the current delivery status and the reason for this delay, otherwise we will be compelled to consider further action.\r\n\r\nRegards,\r\nThe Innovators Digital Ads Pvt. Ltd.\r\nSolitaire Valley, Jhalwa, Prayagraj\r\n', '2025-11-23 05:13:21'),
