(408, 'Jay Thakkar', 'jayht88@gmail.com', '7600741478', 'REQUIREMENT OF TMT BARS - KJ CS PVT LTD', 'Namaste Sir, \r\n\r\nThis is Jay Thakkar from KJ CS PVT LTD.\r\n\r\nWe have a requirement of TMT BARS for our upcoming cold storage project.\r\n\r\nAttached herewith is our GST CERTIFICATE.\r\n\r\nBelow is our location link & address.\r\n\r\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/7EZqgs8oUD4TFGaQA\r\n\r\nPLOT NO 8,9,10 ( NEW 30,31,32 ) HARIOM INDUSTRIAL PARK, PALDI KANKAJ, PIRANA DARGAH ROAD,AHMEDABAD, GUJARAT 382425.\r\n\r\nAttached is our requirement.\r\n\r\nPls share your best rates & contact details for the same.', '2025-11-24 13:00:30'),
