(423, 'Charutha Rajarathna ', 'charutha@lanlo.lk', '+94774444424', 'Strategic investment- Sri Lanka ', 'Dear Sir/Madam - Executive Board, \r\n\r\nGreetings from Sri Lanka.\r\n\r\nWe are reaching out from Lankaloha Hardware Limited (the former Ceylon State Hardware Corporation of Sri Lanka est. 1963) to present a strategic opportunity that may align with your companyâ€™s global manufacturing goals.\r\n\r\nA complete manufacturing facility including land, buildings, machinery (& longstanding brand) built for any type of large-scale operation, steel-related and/ or any other form of factory process. \r\nThe facilities currently consist of a hoe, rotary blade & cutlery manufacturing line amongst other machinery (forging, pressing, finishing) relating to products contributing to the sectors of hardware, construction, mining, irrigation, hospitality supplies, etc.\r\nThe land, plants & facilities are fully capable of being expanded and upgraded to meet substantial operations and business goals at global quality standards, making it suitable for high-grade export production.\r\n\r\nFacilities and properties of this caliber are rare in Sri Lanka, with only a few such plants existing worldwide.\r\nThis presents a unique chance to secure a ready-made operation and 60+ year highly-recognised household brand with significant value and potential.\r\n\r\nShould this be of interest, please refer the attachment of the Acquisition Proposal (more information available on www.hardwarecorporation.lk). We would be pleased to share any further details upon request. \r\n\r\nLooking forward to a favourable response.\r\n\r\nThank you,\r\n\r\nYours Sincerely,\r\n\r\nCharutha Rajarathna\r\nSupply Chain & Strategic Investment ', '2025-11-29 13:32:44'),
