(450, 'Monirul', 'monirul@piphotonics.co.jp', '810535819683', 'Meeting for business safety', 'Good morning\r\nCould you kindly point me to the right person who handles operations safety or maintenance? Could we schedule a 10-minute web call to discuss?\r\n\r\nIâ€™m from PI PHOTONICS, Japan. We help steel plants make crane operations safer with our patented high-visibility safety lighting, which creates clear zones and guides for the craneâ€™s load path. Leading producers like Nippon Steel are using it to prevent accidents and save millions.\r\nuse case: https://www.piphotonics.com/en/crane-safety-light/', '2025-12-08 06:55:23'),
