(453, 'Prakhar Agarwal', 'pagarwal@sberbank.ru', '9359723544', 'Business Introduction & Enquiry (SBERBANK RUSSIA) __ TMT BARS 10 MM 12 MM & 16 MM', 'Dear Sir/Madam,\r\n \r\nGreetings of the Day !\r\n \r\n This is Prakhar Agarwal from the Export Team, SBERBANK Russia ( SberBank is the largest bank in Russia, Central and Eastern Europe, and one of the leading international financial institutions).\r\nOn behalf of SBER Bank (India), we are reaching out to highlight potential business opportunities aimed at expanding Indian businesses within Russian markets to enable foster growth opportunities for Indian enterprises seeking to enter the Russian market.\r\n As part of our SBER Bank (Business Development), our goal is to facilitate and promote bilateral trade and investment between India and Russia, leveraging the vast potential that exists in both markets.\r\n \r\nKindly share your Company profile/Presentation, product list, export experience , product technical data sheet and contact personal details for further evaluation and discussion.\r\n\r\nRequirements :- total 5000 tonnes \r\n1.	TMT bars 12 mm â€“ 3000 tonnes\r\n2.	TMT bars 10 mm â€“ 2000 tonnes\r\n3.	TMT bars 16 mm â€“ 1000 tonnes\r\nAlso Please confirm your Incoterm:\r\n\r\nIncoterm	Full Name and Explanation\r\nEx-Work	Ex Works (Ex-Works): The seller makes the goods available at their premises (e.g., warehouse in India). The buyer is responsible for all transportation costs, risks, and duties from that point onward.\r\nFOB	Free On Board: The seller delivers the goods on board the vessel at the port of shipment (e.g., Indian port). The buyer bears the costs and risks from that point, including freight and insurance.\r\nCIF	Cost, Insurance, and Freight: The seller pays for transportation to the port of destination (e.g., Russian port), including insurance. The buyer handles unloading, customs, and further inland transport.\r\nDAP	Delivered At Place: The seller delivers the goods to a place agreed upon in the buyer\'s country (e.g., buyer\'s location in Russia), ready for unloading. The buyer is responsible for customs duties.\r\nDDP	Delivered Duty Paid: The seller handles everything, including paying import duties, and delivers the goods to the buyer\'s specified location (e.g., in Russia). The seller bears all risks and costs.\r\n\r\nPlease feel free to reach out, in case of any query.\r\n\r\nBest Regards,\r\nPrakhar Agarwal\r\nSberbank India, Manager\r\nBusiness Development Department \r\nCell | +91 9359723544\r\n', '2025-12-10 06:18:26'),
