(489, 'nandha kumar', 'purchase@ushaconstructions.co.in', '9698025555', 'Steel Supply Enquiry for MES Projects', 'We are Usha Constructions, Government Contractors executing various projects for the MES Department across multiple locations. We are currently handling ongoing projects in Kochi and have recently taken over a new MES project at Ambala.\r\n\r\nAs part of this project, we are in the process of finalizing a steel supplier. As per MES Department approvals, your brand is among the specified approved brands, and hence we would like to initiate contact with you.\r\n\r\nThe project is presently at a very initial stage, and before proceeding with any purchase, we are required to finalize the supplier and obtain approval from the MES Department. In this regard, we would like to understand your supply capabilities, factory locations, distribution network, and other relevant details.\r\n\r\nWe request you to kindly contact us at your convenience so that we may discuss further and explore a potential business relationship.\r\n\r\nLooking forward to your response.\r\n\r\nThanking you.', '2025-12-22 12:25:53'),
