(500, 'NIHARIKA SINGH ', 'niharikasingh1055@gmail.com', '8009821975', 'regarding job post in you comany for graduate engineering training', 'Hello Sir/Madam,\r\n\r\nI am writing to express my interest in job opportunities for Graduate Engineer Trainee or entry-level engineering roles in your organization.\r\n\r\nI am a recent engineering graduate with strong academic fundamentals and a keen interest in learning and contributing to core industry operations. I am disciplined, hardworking, and open to on-site responsibilities. I am particularly interested in gaining hands-on exposure in a reputed organization like Gallantt, where I can develop practical skills and grow professionally.\r\n\r\nI would be grateful if you could let me know about any suitable openings or the procedure to apply further. I am available to join immediately and can share my resume and additional details upon request.\r\n\r\nThank you for your time and consideration.\r\n\r\nRegards,\r\nNiharika Singh\r\nMobile: +91 8009821975\r\nEmail: niharikasingh1055@gmail.com', '2025-12-23 12:02:08'),
