(559, 'Abdurrahman', 'abdurrahmankhan97@gmail.com', '09670702578', ' Application for Civil Construction Vacancy', 'I am writing to inquire about any current or upcoming vacancy in the Civil Construction department in your esteemed organization.\r\n\r\nI am a Civil Engineering professional with recent work experience at Maa Mahamaya Steel Industries, where I was involved in civil constructionâ€“related works. I have hands-on experience in site execution, RCC works, quantity estimation, coordination with contractors, and quality control.\r\n\r\nI am keen to contribute my skills and experience to your organization and would welcome an opportunity to discuss how I can add value to your ongoing or future projects.\r\n\r\nPlease find my resume attached for your kind consideration. I shall be grateful if you consider my application for any suitable position.\r\n\r\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-01-07 10:15:20'),
