(576, 'Souvik Mondal', 'souvik@cfloworld.com', '8335806622', 'Iron Ore Beneficiation & Washing Plant', 'We CFlo World Limited,a leading innovator in modular wet processing technologies,delivering bespoke equipment solutions across construction sand and aggregate washing, waste recycling, ore beneficiation, and critical mineral recovery.\r\nWith 18 years of expertise and a presence in 17 countries, CFlo drives sustainable alternatives to natural sand,repurposes construction and demolition (C&D) waste for the circular economy, and enhances the value of mined ores and critical minerals for high-tech industries such as EVs, solar energy, and advanced manufacturing.\r\nWith over 475 successful installations, CFlo is on a mission to help 100 countries replace natural sand with environmentally responsible alternatives. Through our B2B marketplace, Doctor Sand Limited, we promote ethical sourcing and actively combat illegal river sand mining.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nOur washing technology offers a transformative solution for your low-grade minerals. By using our technology, you can derive three distinct and valuable products:\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n1. Blast Furnace Feed Size (-40mm to +20)\r\n\r\n2. DRI Plant Feed Size (-20mm to +5mm)\r\n\r\n3. Pellets Plant Feed Material Size will be below 5/3 mm\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nThis innovative approach ensures that your raw material is fully utilized, enhancing operational efficiency and profitability across your facilities.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nOur marquee clients to name a few:\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nSuper Smelters Limited, Jamuria (Multiple Plants)\r\n\r\nJai Balaji Jyoti Ltd.Rourkela - 100tph\r\n\r\nJai Balaji Industries Ltd, Durgapur (multiple plants)\r\n\r\nKashvi International. Keonjhar-100tph\r\n\r\nSuraj Products Limited Rourkela- 50 tph\r\n\r\nPH Enterprises, Barbil-100tph\r\n\r\nSteel Authority of India Ltd (SAIL)\r\n\r\nFACOR (Vedanta)\r\n\r\nBhushan Power & Steel (multiple plants)\r\n\r\nJindal Steel & Power (multiple plants)\r\n\r\nAdhunik Metaliks (multiple plants)\r\n\r\nMaheshwary Ispat Ltd\r\n\r\nSri Lakshmi minerals\r\n\r\nSri Ganesh Sponge Iron p Ltd\r\n\r\nMonnet Ispat\r\n\r\nShri Bajrang Power & Ispat Ltd.\r\n\r\nPacific Exports\r\n\r\nMaa Tarini Steel LLP, Mayurbhanj 100tph\r\n\r\nNarbheram Power & Steel Pvt. Ltd.\r\n\r\nGeomini Industries\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nKey benefits of the mineral processing and beneficiation plant: \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n1.        Feeding Arrangement\r\n\r\n2.        Conveying System\r\n\r\n3.        Scrubbing Units\r\n\r\n4.        Wet Sizing\r\n\r\n5.        Intense Dual Washing through Hydro-Cyclone\r\n\r\n6.        De-Watering System\r\n\r\n7.        Product Stockpile Conveyors\r\n\r\n8.        Water Management System\r\n\r\n9.        Sludge Management System\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n(Please refer to the  Brochure for further details)   \r\n\r\n \r\nThe advantages of our system are:\r\n\r\n\r\n1.   Maximise the recovery of minerals.\r\n\r\n2.   Optimize your mineral gradation.\r\n\r\n3.   95% water recovery through integrated water and sludge management systems.\r\n4.   No noise pollution.\r\n5.   Single chassis hence less civil work.\r\n6.   Designed like a mobile system\r\n7.   Fully automatic control.\r\n8.   Compact design.\r\n9.   Know your production, run time, etc.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nVideo Link 1:\r\n\r\nMineral Processing and Beneficiation Unit: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xyw8HlViQsk\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nVideo Link 2:\r\n\r\nMineral Processing and Beneficiation Unit: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aG5xNMOU9zA\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nVideo Link 3:\r\n\r\nMineral Processing and Beneficiation Unit:\r\n\r\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=67SSezoqX-g&t=16s\r\n\r\n ', '2026-01-12 09:04:42'),
