(580, 'Amit Gupta', 'amit.oilskimmer@oilskimmer.in', '9422005688', 'Sub : OIL SKIMMER TO REMOVE WASTE FLOATING OIL Greetings from PREMIER   We would like to introduce â€œPremier Oil Skimmerâ€ which has come a long way ever since its establishment in the year 1994 and has established a strong foothold in the Indian market', 'Greetings from PREMIER\r\n \r\nWe would like to introduce â€œPremier Oil Skimmerâ€ which has come a long way ever since its establishment in the year 1994 and has established a strong foothold in the Indian market.\r\n \r\nWe are in the field of manufacturing of Oil Skimmer Machine, Pune INDIA.\r\n \r\n \r\nWe look forward to receive your earliest and positive reply and the details.\r\n \r\nPlease click on our website www.oilskimmer.in to view oil skimmerâ€™s photos and working oil skimmer video and details.\r\nPl call if any more technical clarification required.\r\n\r\nRegards / à¤§à¤¨à¥à¤¯à¤µà¤¾à¤¦\r\n \r\nAmit Gupta\r\nContact No For Delivery and commercial Matters.: 7058571082\r\n Email- amit.oilskimmer@oilskimmer.in\r\nWebsite  www.oilskimmer.in\r\nHSN CODE: 84211999        Our GST No :27AAGCP0113L1ZK\r\nMSME UAN No. - UDYAM-MH-26-0008288\r\n--\r\nThanks & Regards\r\nAmit Gupta 9422005688\r\npremier oilskim systems pvt.ltd.\r\nPlot No. T â€“ 165 / 3 / 7, Priyadarshani Industrial Estate,\r\nMIDC, Bhosari, Pune â€“ 411026. Maharashtra, INDIA.\r\nWebsite:- www.oilskimmer.in  \r\nE mail:- amit.oilskimmer@oilskimmer.in \r\n', '2026-01-13 11:07:13'),
