(645, 'SNEHA M', 'sneha@vtivalves.com', '08668933725', 'Company Profile :   VTI GROUP     |   Product - Valves, Pipe, Fitting & Flages, Pressure Vessel . ', 'Company Profile :   VTI GROUP     |   Product - Valves, Pipe, Fitting & Flages, Pressure Vessel.\r\n Dear Sir / Maâ€™am,\r\n\r\nGreetings from VTI Group!\r\n\r\nI hope this email finds you well !\r\n\r\nMy name is Ms. Sneha M., I am the General Manager â€“ Operations at Valves Olin.  We are pleased to share a small introduction about our company.   We are API certified manufacturer of Industrial Valves, We operate as â€œValve Tech Industries in Indiaâ€ and â€œValves Olin in the UAEâ€, with a manufacturing unit located in Navi Mumbai Taloja MIDC, India, establishing a robust presence across both India and the UAE.\r\n\r\nWe would like to introduce our various types and ranges of valves to your company.\r\n\r\nClick Here for Potential Valve reference           |            Catalogue           |           Company Video           |            PPT           |           Certificates & Approvals    |      Pressure Vessel \r\n\r\nâ€œWE ARE PROUD TO SAY THAT â€œOUR PRODUCT QUALITY IS EXCELLENT.â€\r\n\r\nOur company is specialized in manufacturing high-quality of Butterfly valve, Plug valve, Globe valve, Gate valve, Ball valve, Check valves, Goggle valve & Strainers, Fabrication Valve , Pipe, fittings, flanges & Pressure Vessel.\r\n\r\n\r\nProduct 	Size â€“ mm	\r\nButterfly Valve                           	25mm to 4600mm    	\r\nGlobe Valve	15mm to 600 mm             	\r\nGate Valve	15mm to 2200 mm     	\r\nBall Valve	10mm to 1200 mm          	\r\nDual Plate Check Valve	50mm to 2200 mm 	\r\nSwing Check Valve	15 mm to 1000 mm	\r\nStrainer	15mm to 900 mm	\r\nPlug Valve	15mm to 500 mm	\r\nGoggle Valve	300mm to 3800mm  	\r\nFabrication Valve	Range upto 4.6 mtr	\r\nPipe	 	\r\nFitting		\r\nFlanges	 	\r\nPressure Vessel		\r\n\r\nWe are proud to hold several important certifications, including. \r\nâ€¢	API \r\nâ€¢	IBR\r\nâ€¢	EIL (Engineers India Ltd)\r\nâ€¢	CE\r\nâ€¢	ISO\r\nâ€¢	BIS\r\n\r\nMoreover, we have received major approvals from renowned organizations such as\r\nâ€¢	MECON\r\nâ€¢	CET\r\nâ€¢	BHEL and \r\nâ€¢	PDIL \r\n\r\nThese approvals reflect our consistent ability to meet the stringent requirements of these esteemed institutions, further validating our expertise and reliability.\r\n\r\nWe would like to extend our invitation for you to visit our factory in Taloja MIDC, Maharashtra, India and see firsthand how we operate. We believe that there is great potential for us to establish a strong and mutually beneficial business relationship. With our commitment to quality and customer satisfaction, we are confident that we can be a valuable partner to your organization. \r\n\r\nI am pleased to provide you with our company profile. To make it easier for you to navigate through the information, I have included clickable buttons for accessing our catalogues, company tour, and company PowerPoint presentation. If you are currently in need of industrial valves or have upcoming projects that require valves. please contact me on +971-568808896 / +91-8668933725   or  sneha@vtivalves.com\r\n\r\nShould you have any questions or require further assistance, please do not hesitate to reach out to me. I am more than happy to provide any additional information or clarify any doubts you may have.\r\nRegards,\r\nMs. Sneha M. \r\nGeneral Manager â€“ Operations\r\n\r\nContact No : +971-568808896   |      Email : sneha@vtivalves.com\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nManufacturing Plant 1: | Valve Tech Industries\r\nPlot no-L-35, 36, 44, M.I.D.C, Taloja,  Taluka - Panvel, Dist. â€“ Raigad, Navi Mumbai- 410208 | INDIA  \r\nContact No : +91-9115717371  |  Email : contact@vtivalves.com\r\n\r\nInternational Branch : | Valves Olin LLC   \r\nOffice No-21, Ground floor, RAG Global Business Hub, Al Hilal bank building, Al Nahda St, Al Qusais, Dubai | UAE\r\nContact No : +971-568808896  \r\n\r\nPLANT TOUR :- CLICK HERE -https://drive