(857, 'Tushar Upadhyay', 'tushar.upadhyay@securemeters.com', '6396995509', 'Enquirey Related Requirement of Energy Monitoring & Optimization Solution for Manesar Plant', 'Dear Sir / Madam,\r\n\r\nMy name is Tushar Upadhyay, and I represent Secure Meters Ltd., where we work on energy efficiency and performance monitoring solutions for industrial utility systems, particularly in steel manufacturing plants.\r\n\r\nWe would like to introduce Censeo, a Secure Meterâ€“based pump performance and efficiency monitoring system, designed specifically to provide continuous, realâ€‘time visibility into pump and utility performance without requiring invasive flow instrumentation.\r\n\r\nOur solution are also contributing in pump performance monitoring in other stell industries.\r\nWe would appreciate the opportunity to:\r\nBriefly understand your existing pump and utility systems, and\r\nDiscuss whether a pilot or evaluation of the Censeo system would be of interest for  your steel plants.\r\nA 20â€“30 minute discussion (online or in person) would allow us to share a focused overview and relevant useâ€‘cases from sugar and process industry applications.\r\nKindly let us know if this solution would be of interest so that we may proceed accordingly.\r\nThank you for your time and consideration.\r\nWe look forward to your response.', '2026-04-01 09:12:40'),
(858, 'GOPAL TRADERS', 'gopaltraderss3377@gmail.com', '8000561234', 'Bulk Scrap Supply Proposal â€“ 1000 MT Ready Stock | Gopal Traders', 'Hello Sir,\r\n\r\nGopal this side from Gopal Traders, Jamnagar.\r\n\r\nWe are dealing in HMS / MS / plate scrap. Currently we have approx. 1000 MT material ready for immediate supply.\r\n\r\nSharing material photos/videos for your reference. Kindly check and let us know your requirement and best rate.\r\n\r\nLocation: Gujarat\r\nImmediate lifting possible.\r\n\r\nRegards,\r\nGopal Traders\r\n+91 8000561234', '2026-04-01 11:40:33'),
