(937, 'Purvi Shah', 'hello@webintservices.com', '9209136407', 'helping in software related work', 'At WebInt Services, we partner with industrial and manufacturing businesses to build reliable, high-performing digital systems:\r\n\r\nâ€¢ inRiver PIM â€“ Get your product data to every sales channel reliably and fast, without manual rework\r\nâ€¢ Web & Commerce Platforms â€“ Responsive, high-performance portals and B2B storefronts built for scale\r\nâ€¢ Mobile Applications â€“ Native apps that connect your field teams, distributors, and customers\r\nâ€¢ AI-powered Automation â€“ Eliminate repetitive workflows and surface actionable insights from your data\r\nâ€¢ QA & Test Automation â€“ Faster releases with zero compromise on quality\r\n\r\nWith 5+ years of experience delivering for global enterprises, we\'d love to understand the specific goals and challenges at your company.hello@webintservices.com\r\n+91 9209136407\r\n', '2026-04-13 12:12:32'),
