(947, 'SUMANT KUSHWAHA', 'sumantkushawaha07@gmail.com', '9696570332', 'Job Application ', 'Dear Sir/Ma\'am,\r\nI am Sumant Kushwaha a final year B.Tech student in NIT Raipur from Metallurgical and Materials Engineering branch.\r\nCurrently, I am looking for Graduate Engineer Trainee (GET) role.\r\nI have done two project internships one is Study of casting defects and Remedial measures from vizag steel plant and other is Reducing FeO content in converter slag from bhilai steel plant .\r\n\r\nWith good knowledge of core subjects like Iron and Steel Making, Heat treatment and Testing of Materials,\r\nI want to join your company and want to contribute to grow your company. Please consider my application.\r\nThank you \r\nThese are my details \r\n Email: sumantkushawaha07@gmail.com \r\nPhone Number: 9696570332', '2026-04-16 18:04:12'),
