(949, 'Jaideep Jaiswal', 'jaideepjaiswal@dhammai.com', '9667940809', 'AI Agents For Production, Logistics and Proactive Maintainance ', 'I am Jaideep Jaiswal, Founder of Dhamm.AI. As an Information Intelligence Research Institution, we specialize in building and deploying highly advanced, reasoning-based AI architectures. I am reaching out because I believe our custom AI agent ecosystems can drive significant operational efficiencies across Galliant Groupâ€™s manufacturing, supply chain, and legal workflows.\r\nAs industrial operations become increasingly complex, off-the-shelf AI is often insufficient. At Dhamm.AI, we develop deeply integrated, autonomous agents designed for precise enterprise use cases:\r\nProduction & Logistics Optimization: We deploy intelligent agents that dynamically analyze supply chain data, optimize logistics routing in real-time, and identify production bottlenecks before they impact output.\r\nProactive Plant Maintenance: Transitioning your facilities from reactive to predictive maintenance. Our agents continuously monitor equipment and sensor telemetry to detect anomalies, predict degradation, and autonomously schedule maintenance, drastically reducing unplanned downtime.\r\nLegal Document Briefing & Analysis: High-precision AI assistants engineered to ingest dense legal documents, contracts, and vendor agreements. These agents rapidly extract key clauses, summarize obligations, and flag compliance risks, allowing your legal and procurement teams to move faster with greater security.\r\nUnlike standard language models, our foundation is built on deep intelligence research and neuro-symbolic reasoning frameworks, ensuring our agents operate with the highest degree of accuracy, logical consistency, and data privacy.\r\nI would welcome the opportunity to schedule a brief 15-minute introductory call next week to discuss Galliant Groupâ€™s current technological roadmap and explore how Dhamm.AI can support your operational goals.', '2026-04-18 14:25:51'),
