(1047, 'Rahul Kumar', 'rahul83kum@gmail.com', '8303501454', 'Miss bahave ', 'Sir, your company is very good and from the manager to the housekeeper, everyone is good but the security here is very useless, here it is only the security at the gate, they do not have the manners to talk at all and the matter is that Sir, before entry here the ID card is checked but the security here is making a complete joke, when they are checking someone\'s ID, they do not say anyone\'s, that they will not check the HR manager or GM, now tell me, is this also true, normal employees are checked and those who ride two wheelers or four wheelers are not checked at all and on top of that there is no time to talk to them at all This is bad Sir, please take action as soon as possible otherwise all these people will defame such a good company, just think if someone comes from outside to work and these people will behave like this with him then everyone will have to face the same thing that this company is useless and if the people here do not have the manners to talk then Sir please I humbly request you to be a little strict on all these guards, thank you', '2026-05-19 05:14:21'),
