(1064, 'SANDEEP YADAV', 'sandeep@algoflowai.com', '7007964907', 'Streamlining Gallant\'s Gate Security & Truck Entry with Smart AI Automation', 'Dear Sir/Management Team,\r\nBadi manufacturing units aur steel plants mein har din saikdo trucks aur workers ki entry hoti hai, jise manually manage karna slow bhi hai aur ismein security risks bhi hote hain. Algo Flow AI lekar aaya hai industry-first Smart Alert AI System jo aapke gate security ko 100% automate aur secure kar dega.\r\nGallant Ke Liye Hamare Special Smart AI Features:\r\nðŸš› Smart Truck & Fleet Tracking: Jaise hi koi truck factory gate par aayega, hamara AI automatically uska Number Plate detect karega, entry time note karega aur bina kisi manual entry ke loading/unloading area ka rasta assign kar dega.\r\nðŸ‘¤ Advanced Face Recognition Gate Entry: Workers aur staff ke liye proxy attendance khatam. Gate par aate hi AI sirf 0.5 seconds mein face recognize karke hi turnstile barrier/gate kholega.\r\nðŸš¨ Unauthorized Entry & Safety Alerts: Agar koi anjaan vyakti (unauthorized person) ya bina proper safety gear (Helmet/Vest) ke koi worker hazardous zone mein entry karega, toh AI instantly control room ko audio-visual alert aur auto-call bhej dega.\r\nChunki hum DPIIT #startupindia aur MSME recognized company hain aur Purvanchal (BHU Purvanchal) se hi operate kar rahe hain, hum aapke maujuda CCTV cameras ke sath is AI system ko bina kisi naye infrastructure kharch ke integrate kar sakte hain.\r\nKya hum is hafte aapki security team ke sath ek 5-minute ka live digital demo schedule kar sakte hain?\r\nRegards,\r\nSandeep Yadav Operations Head, Algo Flow AI ðŸ“ž +91 7007964907 | ðŸŒ www.algoflowai.com', '2026-05-26 09:02:48'),
(1065, 'Bhanu Pratap ', 'bhanugkp22@gmail.com', '09336926903', 'Application for summer internship 2026', 'Respected HR,\r\nI am Bhanu Pratap, currently pursuing Material Science and Engineering from NIT Patna. I am writing to express my interest in an internship opportunity at Gallantt Industries, Gorakhpur.\r\n\r\nI am eager to gain industrial exposure and enhance my practical knowledge in the field of materials and manufacturing. Kindly consider my application for a suitable internship role.\r\n\r\nThank you for your time and consideration.\r\n\r\nBest Regards,\r\nBhanu Pratap\r\nMaterial Science and Engineering, NIT Patna\r\nContact: 9336926903\r\n', '2026-05-26 09:35:38'),
