(1096, 'Avanish Choudhary', 'cavanish169@gmail.com', '9170391838', 'Internship', 'Subject: Application for Internship – Mechanical Engineering Student (June–July 2026)\r\n\r\nName: Avanish Choudhary\r\nInstitution: IMS Engineering College, Ghaziabad\r\nDegree: B.Tech – Mechanical Engineering\r\nCurrent Year: 3rd Year\r\nContact Number: 9170391838\r\n\r\nSkills:Dear Hiring Manager,\r\n\r\nI am writing to express my sincere interest in securing an internship opportunity at Ankur Udyog Steel Company. I believe this internship will provide me with invaluable industry exposure and allow me to contribute meaningfully to your esteemed organization.\r\n\r\nPlease find my details below:\r\n\r\n• Basic Manufacturing Processes\r\n\r\nI am available for the internship during the period of June 2026 to July 2026, and I am flexible within this timeframe to suit your organization\'s requirements.\r\n\r\nI am a highly motivated and dedicated student eager to apply my academic knowledge in a real-world industrial environment. Ankur Udyog Steel Company\'s reputation in the steel industry makes it an ideal place for me to learn and grow professionally.\r\n\r\nI would be grateful for the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team. Please feel free to contact me at the number provided above.\r\n\r\nThank you for considering my application. I look forward to a positive response.\r\n\r\nYours sincerely,\r\nAvanish Choudhary\r\nB.Tech – Mechanical Engineering (3rd Year)\r\nIMS Engineering College, Ghaziabad\r\nContact: 9170391838', '2026-06-04 14:08:29'),
