(1106, 'Shreyansh Mani Tripathi', 'smanitripathi544@gmail.com', '06386459327', 'Internship ', 'Dear Hiring Manager,\r\nI am a BBA student at Gorakhpur with over 3 years of hands-on experience in business operations, sales, and marketing. I am highly motivated to contribute to Gallantt and learn from your professional team through an internship opportunity.  \r\nI am eager to apply my skills in business management and customer handling to support your company\'s goals. I have attached my resume for your review and would appreciate the opportunity to discuss how I can add value to your organization.  \r\nThank you for your time and consideration.\r\nBest regards,\r\nShreyansh Mani Tripathi\r\nPhone: 6386459327', '2026-06-07 06:26:28'),
