(1149, 'Neeraj Tiwari', 'mdneeraj@yahoo.com', '9891660303', 'Follow-Up: Industrial Storage Tanks, Pressure Vessels, Reactors & heat exchanger', 'Dear Sir/Madam,\r\nProject/Procurement\r\nGreetings from NM Technical Solution.\r\n\r\nI hope this email finds you well.\r\n\r\nWe are pleased to introduce NM Technical Solution, a Noida-based engineering and fabrication company specializing in the design, manufacturing, and installation of mechanical static equipment and turnkey mechanical solutions. With over 12 years of industry experience, we have successfully served clients across the Oil & Gas, Petrochemical, Chemical, Distillery, Power, Steel, Cement, and Process Industries in India and overseas.\r\n\r\nOur Core Expertise\r\n\r\n• Hydraulic Truck Tipplers\r\n\r\nHeavy-duty unloading systems with capacities up to 100 tons\r\nAdvanced hydraulic tilting mechanisms for efficient bulk material handling\r\nCustom-designed solutions for mining, cement, power, and logistics sectors\r\n• Pressure Vessels & Storage Tanks\r\n\r\nStainless Steel (SS) and Carbon Steel (CS) fabrication\r\nDesigned and manufactured as per ASME Section VIII Div. I & Div. II standards\r\nHigh-quality welding, testing, and inspection procedures\r\n• Heat Exchangers\r\n\r\nShell & Tube Heat Exchangers\r\nCustom thermal design and fabrication\r\nOptimized for maximum performance, reliability, and operational efficiency\r\n• Mechanical Static Equipment\r\n\r\nHSD Storage Tanks\r\nPressure Vessels\r\nDiesel Storage Tanks\r\nChemical Storage Tanks\r\nIndustrial Storage Tanks\r\nReactors and Process Equipment\r\nSilos\r\nPEB Structures\r\nCustomized Fabricated Equipment\r\n• Power & Process Piping\r\n\r\nComplete piping fabrication and erection services\r\nInstallation, testing, and commissioning support\r\nTurnkey execution for industrial projects\r\nAt NM Technical Solution, we are committed to delivering technically sound, safe, and cost-effective solutions. Our engineering team utilizes advanced design software such as PV Elite, SolidWorks, and AutoCAD to ensure precision, compliance, and quality at every stage of project execution.\r\n\r\nWe would appreciate the opportunity to discuss how our capabilities can support your current and upcoming projects. Please find our Company Profile/Product Catalog attached for your reference.\r\n\r\nWe would be delighted to arrange a brief introductory meeting or call at your convenience.\r\n\r\nThank you for your time and consideration. We look forward to the opportunity of working with your esteemed organization.\r\n\r\nThanks & Regards:-\r\nNeeraj Tiwari (MD)\r\n\r\nMob- 9891550303 & 9891660303\r\nNM Technical Solution (Noida) \r\n\r\nMdneeraj@yahoo.com & Mdneeraj@nmts.in \r\n\r\n(www.nmts.in) & (www.nmtechnicalsolution.in)\r\n\r\n(Noida-U.P.)Pin-201307 INDIA\r\n ', '2026-06-18 06:46:57'),
