(1154, 'Rachel Smith', 'sales@reachridge.com', '9179977619', 'Veterinary accounts matched to your exact market', 'Hi,\r\n\r\nI noticed your company is active in the veterinary market, so I thought this may be relevant to your outreach team.\r\n\r\nAt Reach Ridge, we help veterinary-focused companies identify the right animal hospitals, specialty practices, emergency clinics, referral centers, and decision-makers to approach.\r\n\r\nWe build focused prospect lists across the US, Canada, the UK, Australia, and European markets, organized by specialty, geography, practice type, ownership type, decision-maker role, and growth signals such as hiring, expansion, multi-location activity, or specialty service focus.\r\n\r\nThis helps your team focus on better-fit veterinary accounts instead of broad or random clinic data.\r\n\r\nI can prepare a small focused sample for one veterinary segment and region your team is currently targeting.\r\n\r\nShould I build it around specialty hospitals, emergency clinics, independent practices, or another segment your team is focused on?\r\n\r\nBest,\r\nRachel with Reach Ridge\r\n', '2026-06-19 12:07:41'),
