(1215, 'M MAREESWARAN', 'mareeswaran.geo@gmail.com', '8754397550', 'Application for Geologist Position (Fresher)', 'Dear Sir/Madam,\r\n\r\nI hope you are doing well.\r\n\r\nI am writing to apply for any suitable Trainee Geologist / Geologist position in your organization.\r\n\r\nI hold an MSc in Geology and have one year of experience as a Trainee Geologist at Adani Cements. During my tenure, I was involved in limestone mine operations, geological sample collection, raw material quality monitoring and coordination with the survey team while doing the DGPS survey & Drone survey.\r\n\r\nI have a strong academic foundation in sedimentology, structural geology, mineralogy, petrology, hydrogeology, remote sensing, and GIS. I am proficient in ArcGIS, QGIS, Google Earth, and MS Office.\r\n\r\nI have attached my resume for your kind consideration. I would be grateful for the opportunity to discuss how my skills and experience can contribute to your organization. I look forward to hearing from you.\r\n\r\nThank you for your time and consideration.\r\n\r\nKind regards,\r\n\r\nM. Mareeswaran\r\nMobile: +91 8754397550\r\nEmail: mareeswaran.geo@gmail.com', '2026-07-13 10:38:08'),
