(1251, 'BRIJKISHOR MADHESIYA', 'madhesiyab@hadeed.com.sa', '+919648118796', 'Regarding career', 'My name is Brijkishor Madhesiya, and I belong to Kushinagar district, which is near the Gallantt Gorakhpur Plant. Currently, I am working as a Senior Technician in Raw Material Laboratory and have experience in quality control, testing, and laboratory operations.\r\n\r\nAs a local resident of the region, I am highly interested in contributing to Gallantt Group and becoming a part of your esteemed organization. I would like to know if there are any current or upcoming vacancies that match my qualifications and experience.\r\n\r\nBeing from the local area, I can join promptly and am committed to delivering my best performance and growing with the organization.\r\n\r\nKindly consider my profile for any suitable opportunities and let me know if recruitment is ongoing. I would be grateful for an opportunity to discuss my candidature further.', '2026-07-23 03:47:17'),
