(1256, 'Suraj Kumar ', 'upsurajkr@gmail.com', '9402240996', 'Request for a 15-Minute Appointment with Hon’ble Mr. Onkar Kanoria', 'Good Morning Sir,\r\n\r\nMy name is Suraj Kumar Prasad. I humbly request a 15-minute appointment with Mr. Onkar Kanoria at his convenience.\r\n\r\nI would like to briefly discuss my FM Radio Project, Film Project, my vision for the development of Gorakhpur, and my public service vision regarding the 2027 Uttar Pradesh Legislative Assembly Election. I would also be grateful to receive his valuable guidance and suggestions.\r\n\r\nI assure you that I will keep the meeting brief and within 15 minutes.\r\n\r\nKindly let me know a convenient date and time for the appointment.\r\n\r\nThank you for your time and consideration.\r\n\r\nRegards,  \r\nSuraj Kumar  \r\n+91 9402240996  \r\nupsurajkr@gmail.com', '2026-07-25 05:44:56'),
