(1271, 'GAURAV', 'gauravsrivastava020@gmail.com', '9667699190', 'DSG International ', 'Greetings from DSG International!\r\n\r\nWe are a professional liaisoning and business facilitation firm, connecting reliable companies, contractors, and service providers with suitable business opportunities across various sectors.\r\n\r\nOur key areas of engagement include Mining & Minerals, Construction & Infrastructure, Solar Energy, CCTV & Security Solutions, Manpower Services, and other industrial and commercial projects.\r\n\r\nAt DSG International, we focus on building strong business connections, facilitating project discussions, and supporting smooth coordination between clients and capable execution partners.\r\n\r\nWe would be pleased to explore potential business opportunities and mutually beneficial collaborations with your esteemed organization.\r\n\r\nRegards,\r\nDSG International', '2026-07-29 06:37:54'),
