(1279, 'Amar Sharma', 'amarsharmamzn123@gmail.com', '09389951231', 'Application for Java Developer (Fresher)', 'Dear Hiring Team,\r\n\r\nI hope you are doing well.\r\n\r\nI wanted to ask if there are any openings for a Java Developer, Backend Developer, or Software Developer role for freshers in your organization.\r\n\r\nI have recently completed my B.Tech in Computer Science and have skills in Core Java, JDBC, MySQL, Hibernate, Spring Boot, and SQL. I would be grateful if you could let me know about any suitable opportunities. I would be happy to participate in an interview or technical assessment.\r\n\r\nThank you for your time and consideration. I look forward to your response.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\n\r\nAmar Sharma', '2026-08-01 09:51:18'),
(1280, 'Mohammad Danish', 'mddanish1190@gmail.com', '08090742234', 'Application for metallurgy or anyother suitable post ', 'Dear sir \r\nI am Mohammad Danish would like to take an opportunity to apply for the post of metallurgist or any other which is suitable for my profile.\r\nI am having perfect knowledge in heat treatment of  steel and in metallurgical  laboratory.\r\n\r\nSo,I request you,if any vacancy is available, please inform me...\r\n\r\nTotal experience - above to 8 years.\r\n\r\nNotice period time: Join for Immediately.\r\n\r\nThanks & Regards, \r\nMohammad Danish \r\nB.Tech (Material Science and Metallurgical engineering)\r\n+91-8090742234\r\n+91-8010633842\r\n', '2026-08-01 12:15:43'),
