(1282, 'Sandeep Mishra ', 'enggmishrasandeep2@gmail.com', '6388503881', 'Job regarding ', 'Hello Sir/Madam,\r\nI hope you are doing well.\r\nI am Sandeep Mishra, a Mechanical Engineer with experience in Production and Operations Management in the manufacturing industry. I am interested in opportunities at Gallantt Ispat Limited for a Production Manager/Operations role.\r\nPlease let me know if there are any suitable openings. I have attached my resume for your kind consideration.\r\nThank you for your time. I look forward to hearing from you.\r\nRegards,\r\nSandeep Mishra', '2026-08-01 17:58:25'),
