(1294, 'Mohamed Said', 'mado181118@gmail.com', '+201009787775', 'High-Grade Egyptian Iron Ore Fines (Fe 62.32%) – USD 59.00/MT FOB Sokhna', 'Dear Procurement Team / Raw Materials Desk,\r\n\r\n\r\n​We are pleased to present our corporate offer for high-grade Iron Ore Fines (Egyptian Origin), backed by a fresh inspection report from Control Union Egypt (Report No. Ore014). The cargo is available for immediate commercial contracting under the following terms:\r\n\r\n\r\n1. Commercial Terms & Logistics\r\n\r\n* Commodity: Iron Ore Fines (Egyptian Origin)\r\n\r\n* Delivery Terms: FOB Sokhna Port, Egypt (Incoterms® 2020)\r\n\r\n* Contract Price: USD 59.00 per Metric Ton FOB\r\n\r\n* Monthly Capacity: 40,000 – 50,000 MT per Month\r\n\r\n* Minimum Order Quantity (MOQ): 25,000 MT (Trial shipment accepted)\r\n\r\n* Payment Terms: 100% Irrevocable Letter of Credit (L/C) at Sight issued by a Top Prime Bank\r\n\r\n* Logistics: Bulk Cargo Only (No Container Shipments)\r\n\r\n\r\n2. Premium Technical Specifications (Control Union Certified)\r\n\r\nA. Guaranteed Chemical Analysis:\r\n\r\n* Total Iron (Fe): 62.32% (Premium / High-Grade Benchmark)\r\n\r\n* Fe2O3: 89.03%\r\n\r\n* Silica (SiO2): 5.5% (Standard Acceptable Range)\r\n\r\n* Alumina (Al2O3): 0.35% (Ultra-low alumina profile – highly efficient for smelting)\r\n\r\n* Phosphorus (P) & Sulphur (S): < 0.01% P / 0.004% S (Premium advantage for blast furnace longevity)\r\n\r\n* Moisture Content: 1.16% (Extremely low - highly favorable for maritime freight cost)\r\n\r\nB. Physical Size Distribution Summary:\r\n\r\n* Above 9.5 mm: ~ 21.6%\r\n* 4.75 mm to 9.5 mm: 20.22%\r\n* Below 4.75 mm (Fines): ~ 58.1%\r\n\r\n\r\n3. Verification & Compliance Documents Enclosed:\r\n\r\n1. Official Inspection Report: Signed and stamped Quality & Quantity Report from Control Union Egypt.\r\n\r\n2. Technical Infographic Flyer: Clear, structured data summary for quick technical clearance.\r\n\r\n3. Verified Stockpile & Site Photos: Actual, on-site photographs proving material readiness and mining/loading asset availability.\r\n\r\nExport Compliance: Our corporate legal team guarantees full mining licensing, customs clearance, and export allocation capabilities from Sokhna Port.\r\n\r\nWe are ready to welcome your technical team for a stockpile inspection upon receipt of your formal Letter of Intent (LOI) or ICPO. We look forward to executing a stable, long-term supply partnership.\r\n\r\n\r\nBest Regards,\r\n\r\nMohamed Said', '2026-08-02 15:34:06'),
